  choiceText: How much should you put into the budget?
  options:
  - id: 7ef9a83f-b196-4831-8b3f-53a6fc5bd9a5
    text: "You throw everything at it. Taking the price up to \xA311,999,999. Still
      technically in budget\u2026"
